{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b4008aa4cd7b0a112e5cb412fb4fe15c998d99855b02c9168722f970c37e8ef8", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nそろそろ、歩の着替えが終わる時間かな？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《爱格拉！！》。\n差不多该到步换完衣服的时候了吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "02847b8929bcd10a0224c754e694e9c2475613213ce5adcc198ba9dcd7353164", "ja": "マイガー！　{$P$}、大変ー！\nピンチピンチ……超ピンチ～っ！！", "zh": "天哪！{$P$}，出大事了——！\n危机危机……超级危机～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4f894ca4afba3f1c71e75810cacdcd534e6d456c2560b7a0239bc2e5e55c683e", "ja": "そんなに慌てて、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "你这么慌慌张张的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bf2455f9f32456d0d1a2bd8fea275f38bd02981e3abcca8dd9efe7e1f5894f6c", "ja": "聞いてよ～！　ベッドの寝心地がよすぎて……\nアタシ、本気で寝ちゃいそうだよ～！", "zh": "听我说～！床舒服得不得了……\n我真的要睡着了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1004_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "251ed44c5ed4ea4ee89166d20eac36f228f25b3b990a1a7e256d4f5f1712654f", "ja": "さっき軽い気持ちで横になったんだ。そしたら、\nだんだん頭がボーっとして、すごい気持ちよくてさ。", "zh": "刚才只是抱着放松一下的心情躺下了。结果，脑袋渐渐变得昏昏沉沉的，舒服得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "940b86eb72b62d10cf85cd45eece7bd72727836af248f98c0cde87940185d5f3", "ja": "仕事中だし寝るわけないなんて思ってたけど……\nううっ、本番でも爆睡しちゃいそうで。", "zh": "虽然想着还在工作，不可能睡着……  \n呜呜，没想到正式演出时也可能睡得很熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6c89cdc074c354813e58e5b93222d500ce8a9bd7f77be3387e4f8be4dbe5a91e", "ja": "せっかくカワイイ格好してるのに、\n寝てる姿撮られるとか、恥ずかしいじゃん！", "zh": "难得穿得这么可爱，\n要是被拍到睡着的样子，不是很丢脸嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1008_p", "source_sha256": "215246adef3f017e54ebff303364da522a64bd5075d59186711577125a07661b", "ja": "そ、そうか。まあ、ピンチって程でもないけどな……。\nどうしてそんなに眠いんだ？　寝れなかったのか？", "zh": "这、这样啊。嗯，倒也没到危机的程度……你怎么这么困？没睡好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "37bc1e167ae4674cc5998b1cad4ef49966a71ca654a09015f651dde009459466", "ja": "……あー、ちょっとね。撮影のイメトレしたり、\nポーズの研究してたら遅い時間に……アハハハッ。", "zh": "……啊——稍微有点。练习想象拍摄时的情景，还研究了姿势，不知不觉就弄到很晚……啊哈哈哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bf2e4eb0ccdc72fe4d54dbbbf5a6038ced2c079a5dc6bb9c2bc5b2e6eff59341", "ja": "なるほど……。今回は寝る時の自然な姿を撮るから、\n適度な眠気があった方がいい写真になるかもな。", "zh": "原来如此……这次要拍摄睡觉时的自然姿态，保持适度的困意，说不定能拍出更好的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "94ee9ab387f68ee1802c0345b24b45d45f6416b742bebed71859ffd758b25c15", "ja": "そ、そう言われると……。\n油断した顔のグラビアって、いいのかな～？", "zh": "这、这么一说……  \n拍下毫无防备的睡颜写真，真的好吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "55738cecbf5845f256224630a2cade53b40f27e0c9334de7937929dec73beb16", "ja": "ふわぁ～……。ううっ、どうしよ。\nホントに眠くなってきた……。", "zh": "呼啊～……呜呜，该怎么办啊。\n真的开始困起来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1013_staff", "source_sha256": "135a504bfa693a7ba20b542cd6b2b46d80ab20e5f680a931407df5739f302b37", "ja": "舞浜さーん、準備お願いしますー！！", "zh": "舞滨小姐，麻烦准备一下——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f1ebadb146bdfaeaa0f73aa07149fe7f4a1040a860e6b4bde3712f73e1ec7cef", "ja": "は、はーい！！　やばい、撮影はじまっちゃう。\n最後まで起きてられる自信ないよ……。", "zh": "好、好的！！糟了，拍摄要开始了。\n我没信心能一直撑到最后不睡着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9e2483511c3a002b8e95fd1f63ecd7baee6dd59ca4263c29bf2da25376bc319d", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。お願いなんだけど……\n本気で寝そうになったら、起こしてくれない？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。拜托你一件事……要是我真的快睡着了，能叫醒我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "4bd8579ce30bb525a16e444713d37a04b0b28dbaa7f74a4c1c30abd8dfcf1b40", "ja": "ああ、わかった。\n熟睡して、撮影が進まないのも困るからな。", "zh": "啊，知道了。\n要是睡得太熟，拍摄没法进行也很麻烦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e2ca8e22593ade6d7d548b0f4f456e23b72f4282b571c4af722e062607dc54a6", "ja": "そうそう！　頼んだよ、{$P$}！\nそれじゃ、行ってきます♪", "zh": "对对！拜托你了，{$P$}！\n那么，我出发啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1018_null", "source_sha256": "44191dc9adb47dfcdc6c2b70e19977cce68291a22a5c41cd3e40f418a64deb5e", "ja": "―　撮影終了後　―", "zh": "——拍摄结束后——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8a8a6983261ee4639396c9dcdb8075d07f9f4644a9ccce9cd49f67ce4d4cb478", "ja": "んーっ……だいじょーぶ。\nちゃんと、起きてる……むにゃむにゃ……。", "zh": "唔——……没事的。\n我好好……醒着呢……呼噜呼噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0293_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8cb3ef513803173e86067672f04f2d2b4924fd166eb13b0e686f1399c7a0af1e", "ja": "（本番中は起きていた歩だが、撮影が終わると熟睡して\nしまった。寝ないよう頑張ったな、歩……おやすみ）", "zh": "（正式演出时的步还醒着，可拍摄一结束就熟睡了。为了不睡着，你已经很努力了，步……晚安）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
